{"segments":[
 {"id":"c06-title-01","scene":"c06-title","lang":"en","text":"Chapter six. The object.","pause":0.4,"cues":["title"]},
 {"id":"c06-title-02","scene":"c06-title","lang":"ar","text":"مَفْعُولٌ بِهِ","pause":0.6,"cues":[]},
 {"id":"c06-rule-01","scene":"c06-rule","lang":"en","text":"Here is the rule. The object is the thing the action falls on.","pause":0.3,"cues":["show","hl:the thing the action falls on"]},
 {"id":"c06-rule-02","scene":"c06-rule","lang":"en","text":"To find it, ask what, or whom, after the verb.","pause":0.3,"cues":["hl:what?","hl:whom?"]},
 {"id":"c06-rule-03","scene":"c06-rule","lang":"en","text":"The object takes naṣb. Its sign is fatha.","pause":0.5,"cues":["hl:Object → naṣb, fatha."]},
 {"id":"c06-ex1-01","scene":"c06-ex1","lang":"en","text":"Example one. The student wrote the lesson.","pause":0.4,"cues":["en"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex1-02","scene":"c06-ex1","lang":"ar","text":"كَتَبَ الطَّالِبُ الدَّرْسَ","pause":0.6,"cues":["sentence"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex1-03","scene":"c06-ex1","lang":"en","text":"First, the verb. Wrote. It is a past verb, so it is fixed.","pause":0.3,"cues":["group:0"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex1-04","scene":"c06-ex1","lang":"en","text":"Who wrote?","pause":0.5,"cues":["ask:1"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex1-05","scene":"c06-ex1","lang":"ar","text":"الطَّالِبُ","pause":0.3,"cues":["group:1","vowel:1"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex1-06","scene":"c06-ex1","lang":"en","text":"The student. That is the doer, so it takes damma.","pause":0.3,"cues":["line:0"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex1-07","scene":"c06-ex1","lang":"en","text":"What did he write?","pause":0.6,"cues":["ask:2"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex1-08","scene":"c06-ex1","lang":"ar","text":"الدَّرْسَ","pause":0.3,"cues":["group:2","vowel:2"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex1-09","scene":"c06-ex1","lang":"en","text":"The lesson. That is the object, so it ends in fatha.","pause":0.4,"cues":["line:1"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex1-10","scene":"c06-ex1","lang":"en","text":"Listen to the ending once more.","pause":0.3,"cues":[]},
 {"id":"c06-ex1-11","scene":"c06-ex1","lang":"ar","text":"كَتَبَ الطَّالِبُ الدَّرْسَ","pause":0.8,"cues":["read:2"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex2-01","scene":"c06-ex2","lang":"en","text":"Example two. Zayd read a book.","pause":0.4,"cues":["en"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex2-02","scene":"c06-ex2","lang":"ar","text":"قَرَأَ زَيْدٌ كِتَابًا","pause":0.6,"cues":["sentence"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex2-03","scene":"c06-ex2","lang":"en","text":"The verb is fixed, and Zayd is the doer, with damma and tanween.","pause":0.3,"cues":["group:0","group:1"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex2-04","scene":"c06-ex2","lang":"en","text":"What did he read?","pause":0.6,"cues":["ask:2"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex2-05","scene":"c06-ex2","lang":"ar","text":"كِتَابًا","pause":0.3,"cues":["group:2","vowel:2"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex2-06","scene":"c06-ex2","lang":"en","text":"A book. It is the object.","pause":0.3,"cues":["line:0"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex2-07","scene":"c06-ex2","lang":"en","text":"It has no al. So it takes fatha with tanween, and an extra alif.","pause":0.5,"cues":[]},
 {"id":"c06-ex3-01","scene":"c06-ex3","lang":"en","text":"Example three. Open the door!","pause":0.4,"cues":["en"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex3-02","scene":"c06-ex3","lang":"ar","text":"اِفْتَحِ البَابَ","pause":0.6,"cues":["sentence"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex3-03","scene":"c06-ex3","lang":"en","text":"This is an order verb. It is fixed.","pause":0.3,"cues":["group:0","line:0"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex3-04","scene":"c06-ex3","lang":"ar","text":"اِفْتَحِ","pause":0.3,"cues":["read:0"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex3-05","scene":"c06-ex3","lang":"en","text":"Hear the kasra on its end. It is only a bridge to al. It is not a case ending.","pause":0.4,"cues":[]},
 {"id":"c06-ex3-06","scene":"c06-ex3","lang":"en","text":"The doer is hidden. It is you.","pause":0.25,"cues":["group:1"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex3-07","scene":"c06-ex3","lang":"en","text":"Open what?","pause":0.6,"cues":["ask:2"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex3-08","scene":"c06-ex3","lang":"ar","text":"البَابَ","pause":0.3,"cues":["group:2","vowel:2"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex3-09","scene":"c06-ex3","lang":"en","text":"The door. That is the object, so it ends in fatha.","pause":0.5,"cues":["line:1"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex4-01","scene":"c06-ex4","lang":"en","text":"Example four. The student read the teacher's book.","pause":0.4,"cues":["en"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex4-02","scene":"c06-ex4","lang":"ar","text":"قَرَأَ الطَّالِبُ كِتَابَ المُدَرِّسِ","pause":0.6,"cues":["sentence"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex4-03","scene":"c06-ex4","lang":"en","text":"The verb is fixed, and the doer takes damma.","pause":0.3,"cues":["group:0","group:1"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex4-04","scene":"c06-ex4","lang":"en","text":"What did he read?","pause":0.6,"cues":["ask:2"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex4-05","scene":"c06-ex4","lang":"ar","text":"كِتَابَ","pause":0.3,"cues":["group:2","vowel:2"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex4-06","scene":"c06-ex4","lang":"en","text":"It is the object, so it ends in fatha.","pause":0.3,"cues":["line:0"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex4-07","scene":"c06-ex4","lang":"en","text":"But it is owned. So it has no tanween.","pause":0.4,"cues":[]},
 {"id":"c06-ex4-08","scene":"c06-ex4","lang":"ar","text":"المُدَرِّسِ","pause":0.3,"cues":["read:3"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex4-09","scene":"c06-ex4","lang":"en","text":"Book of the teacher. The teacher is the owner. The owner takes kasra.","pause":0.5,"cues":["line:1"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex4-10","scene":"c06-ex4","lang":"en","text":"A tip. An order verb that ends in sukūn takes a small kasra before al.","pause":0.4,"cues":["tip"]},
 {"id":"c06-ex4-11","scene":"c06-ex4","lang":"ar","text":"اِفْتَحِ البَابَ","pause":0.4,"cues":[]},
 {"id":"c06-ex4-12","scene":"c06-ex4","lang":"ar","text":"اِشْرَبِ المَاءَ","pause":0.4,"cues":[]},
 {"id":"c06-ex4-13","scene":"c06-ex4","lang":"en","text":"The verb is still fixed.","pause":0.6,"cues":[]}
]}
